{"id":"vod_bf_21013","vodId":"21013","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"龙与虎","name_cn":"龙与虎","date":"2008-01-01","year":"2008","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-22/e5200b53db81c017ccb55deff693f539.jpg"},"summary":"新的学期开始了，外表凶狠但内心纯良的少年高须龙儿（间岛淳司 配音）决心利用重新分班的机会一扫往日同学对他的误解。更让他高兴的是，自己即将和暗恋了一年有余的栉枝实乃梨（堀江由衣 配音）成为同班同学。除此之外，还有多年的死党北村祐作（野岛裕史 配音）陪伴，一段崭新的高中生活展现在了龙儿的眼前。少女逢坂大河（钉宫理惠 配音）的出现吸引了龙儿的目光，并不是因为此人傲娇腹黑的别扭个性，而是因为在偶然中，龙儿发现，大河居然暗恋着自己的好友祐作。　　在相互坦白了暗恋对象后，龙儿和大河决定结成统一的恋爱战线，利用相互的帮助来完成各自的恋爱蓝图。但现实并没有想象的那么简单，在重重的误会和波折之中，两人似乎对对方都产生了超越友谊的情感。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"喜剧,爱情,动画,喜,日韩动漫"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2025-04-02 18:03:31","classic":true,"classicRank":18,"franchise":"龙与虎","playable":true,"episodeCount":25,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/replacexxx0810/20240930KpPtBLBoindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/replacexxx0810/20240930mKwtX7mFindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/replacexxx0810/20240930TGVGT1L3index.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/replacexxx0810/20240930jbvt4bElindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/replacexxx0810/202409305RSG3uXqindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/replacexxx0810/20240930YxMPEj2jindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/replacexxx0810/20240930Z0efzT3Lindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/replacexxx0810/20240930F4CuV21Uindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/replacexxx0810/20240930brwSOHb1index.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/replacexxx0810/20240930bQtajTzHindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.dd